    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "IoT TwinMaker is a service with which you can build operational digital twins of physical systems. IoT TwinMaker overlays measurements and analysis from real-world sensors, cameras, and enterprise applications so you can create data visualizations to monitor your physical factory, building, or industrial plant. You can use this real-world data to monitor operations and diagnose and repair errors.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Mike Ralphson\n Email: mike.ralphson@gmail.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
